done: [2026-07-31 pm] #34 grilled + 3 bugs filed. Interactive /craft:grill of the #34 spec (internal/GRILL-medsim-chunked-run-gates-2026-07-31.md, ead5862): 9 branches (B1–B9) — on_violation stop-with-data-carrying-condition, A.2 configurable thresholds + auto column selection over continuous estimate_cols (named default "estimate" matches NO real column), A.1 self-validating contiguity (no external nsim), D pilot-identity assert before value-match, C SHA auto-detect, B login-shell shebang + write-time output path. Empirical verification then filed: #36 (chunked runs collide replication ids; medsim_analyze reports chunk size 5 as n_replications for nsim=20 — reproduced; fix = persist global_rep_id + metadata_cols registration, is #34's prerequisite), #37 (generated submit template plain #!/bin/bash → module: command not found on Hopper; repo's own inst/hopper-tests script documents -l required — confirmed), #38 (bonus find: chunks overwrite each other's intermediate results_scenario_N.csv, index-only key, same class as #27; .rds combine unaffected — reproduced 4 chunks → 1 csv). Review returned: 26 findings (19 CONFIRMED, 7 empirical) → spec v2 (dd1c318) locked single-global-replication architecture + R1–R10 amendments. #34 SPEC FULLY IMPLEMENTED on branch feature/chunked-run-prereqs (dde3692 → 8797740, pushed; base dev@dd1c318): P1–P3 (global replication ids/schema v2, combine metadata rebuild, failure-row schema — fixes #36+#38+2 crashers) + Gate A (seed-provenance audit, data-carrying medsim_combine_violation, medsim_audit_results() export) + Gate B (hardened login-shell template — fixes #37; exemplar swept) + Gates C+D (provenance header w/ auto-SHA + single-SHA assert; pilot-subset control, identity-first). Full suite in-tree 1077 PASS / 0 FAIL / 1 SKIP; --as-cran 0/0/1-known-NOTE (also fixed the .rforge.yaml/.flow hidden-file NOTE from today via .Rbuildignore). BREAKING: expected_chunks/missing-chunk handling now stop-by-default (interim looks: on_violation="warn"). Doc sync done via 3 parallel agents (vignette audit section, _pkgdown.yml index, cross-refs). Post-implementation: adversarial branch review IN FLIGHT (pre-integration gate); quality-fixes branch started on worktree ~/.git-worktrees/medsim/feature-quality-fixes (feature/quality-fixes, base dev@8042d0f) — mojibake sweep committed (0f21923); 2 agents implementing the review's non-#34 findings (S4 closed-form pmed truth, X2 validation, X5 interval table, S1 seed_stream deprecation, X6 cache doc; R1/R6/R3/E1/C1 dedup refactors, bit-identity gated). Deferred: E4 truth-recompute race (cluster.R, waits for #34 integration), X1 config$seed doc. Note: medsim_run_chunk() has no compute_truth passthrough (unfiled, possibly by-design). [2026-07-31] Issue triage + #34 spec. Closed 3 stale-open issues after verifying against dev: #24 gauge estimand (exported/documented/tested), #25 ADEMP gates (PR #26), #27 truth-cache collision (fixed by .medsim_truth_fingerprint guard PR #31 + green regression test). Adversarial re-review of the 3 closures: #25/#27 SOUND; #24 PARTIAL — BCa CI arm (gate-A3) + ci=/se_method= interface from the issue's Ask were never delivered though closed as "fully shipped" → filed follow-up #35 (not reopened; headline analytic-vs-percentile grid is served). Drafted+committed internal/SPEC-medsim-chunked-run-gates-2026-07-31.md (#34, f59b922) with grill ledger G1–G9; grill spine finding: global_rep_id computed for seeding only, never persisted (runner.R:402 stores local rep_id) → #34-A/#34-D need a prerequisite column, which also fixes an n_replications under-count for combined chunk runs (analyze.R:236). #34 Part B subsumes unshipped #28B — cross-linked #34↔#28. Added .flow/obsidian-sync.yml (savant report/session delivery). Open issues now: #28, #29, #34 (spec'd), #35. [2026-07-31] pkgdown internal-doc leak closed — CLAUDE.md was being published as live CLAUDE.html (pkgdown renders every root .md). Untracked + gitignored CLAUDE.md & AGENTS.md (kept on disk for agents), filed .rforge.yaml with site.allowlist (vignettes/.gitignore false positive) — commit 277c2f8. Purged live gh-pages/CLAUDE.html (404 confirmed); index.html still 200. Only root CLAUDE.html was ever deployed (other scratch htmls were local-build-only). Won't recur: files not in committed tree, so neither CI nor clean-ref deploy rebuilds them. #30 fix(run_chunk): deterministic per-replication seeding via .medsim_det_seed(), independent of chunk/worker/cluster-type/order — fixes SLURM chunk-collapse (coverage pinned at 1.0). #31 two-tier test infra: Tier-A CRAN guards + Tier-B Hopper suite (12,000 reps @ production scale: nominal coverage 0.947, narrow-interval 0.480, 12,000/12,000 distinct seeds, FORK-reproducible — all PASS), surfaced 5 more latent fixes. dev is CRAN-clean: R CMD check --as-cran 0/0/0 (real notes only — .remember/ note is a local-only artifact, absent on clean CI checkout), devtools::test() 968/0/1. #25 ADEMP coverage gates MERGED to dev 2026-06-22 (PR #26; coverage MCSE + failed-run logging + performance table + nsim helper + SE-vs-estimate plot; 913/0, CI green all platforms). Also fixed a pre-existing dev pkgdown failure (Sobol index gap from #22) + CLAUDE.md Remotes drift (medfit→medrobust). v0.3.1 RELEASED 2026-06-19.
